%% State 01 — Current configurable task-status categories
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Category overview only. Organization-specific status/edge detail stays in task_statuses + task_workflow_transitions.

stateDiagram-v2
direction TB
    state "TODO category" as todo
    state "IN_PROGRESS category" as progress
    state "DONE category" as done
    state "CANCELLED category" as cancelled

    [*] --> todo : create task / organization default status
    todo --> progress : configured start-work path<br/>[assignment guard when required]
    progress --> done : configured completion path
    todo --> cancelled : configured cancellation
    progress --> cancelled : configured cancellation
    cancelled --> todo : configured reopen path
    done --> [*] : seeded default terminal path

    note right of progress
        task_status_id is canonical; tasks.status is a mirror.
        Organizations configure statuses and edges.
        IN_REVIEW belongs to IN_PROGRESS.
        Empty transition rows invoke permissive fallback.
    end note

    note right of done
        Any DONE-category status:
        • completes active assignments;
        • backstop-creates missing review sessions;
        • preserves review obligations.
    end note
